<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classIngressAsyncRunner" kindref="compound">IngressAsyncRunner</ref> class is used for launching just the HDTN Ingress module into its own process. The <ref refid="classIngressAsyncRunner" kindref="compound">IngressAsyncRunner</ref> provides a blocking Run function which creates and initializes an Ingress object by processing/using the various command line arguments. <ref refid="classIngressAsyncRunner" kindref="compound">IngressAsyncRunner</ref> is only used when running HDTN in distributed mode in which there is a single process dedicated to Ingress. <ref refid="classIngressAsyncRunner" kindref="compound">IngressAsyncRunner</ref> also provides a signal handler listener to capture Ctrl+C (SIGINT) events for clean termination. </para>
</sect1>
